        "event_narrative": "A member of the public reported seeing twin or sister waterspouts in Marathon_ FL around 712 pm EDT earlier in the evening. The report came in via social media with a picture and Broadcast media forwarded the photo to us by tagging us in the message. The first waterspout on the left showed the visible condensation funnel extended from the base of the cloud to just behind the homes in the picture. The condensation funnel was skinny. A spray ring was not visible due to homes and trees obstructing the view. The second waterspout on the right was slightly larger with the condensation funnel extending about a quarter of the way down from the base of the cloud. A spray ring was also not visible due to homes and trees obstructing the view."
