        "event_narrative": "Corrects previous waterspout report from 3 W Marathon. A member of the public reported seeing twin or sister waterspouts in Marathon_ FL around 712 pm EDT earlier in the evening. The report came in via social media with a picture and Broadcast media forwarded the photo to us by tagging us in the message. The first waterspout on the left showed the visible condensation funnel extended from the base of the cloud to just behind the homes in the picture. The condensation funnel was skinny. A little later on_ a video came in on social media of the first waterspout near the Seven-Mile Bridge. The condensation funnel was clearly more moderate sized and clearly had a robust spray ring at the water surface. The second waterspout on the right was slightly larger with the condensation funnel extending about a quarter of the way down from the base of the cloud. A spray ring was also not visible due to homes and trees obstructing the view."
